WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.667 --> 00:00:17.189
Danny: What’s happening?

2
00:00:17.190 --> 00:00:20.232
Brad: He’s doing something with the straw.

3
00:00:20.233 --> 00:00:26.878
Tina: I’ve got a bad feeling.

4
00:00:26.879 --> 00:00:40.998
Danny: No, no, no!

5
00:00:40.999 --> 00:00:45.898
Tina: He’s getting bigger!

6
00:00:45.899 --> 00:00:48.704
Brad: Look, everything is fading!

7
00:00:48.705 --> 00:00:50.646
Danny: I know. I know.

8
00:00:50.647 --> 00:00:56.489
Tina: We’ve got to do something!

9
00:00:56.490 --> 00:00:59.127
Brad: Grab the straw.

10
00:00:59.128 --> 00:01:01.865
Danny: Stop him!

11
00:01:01.866 --> 00:01:04.523
Tristay: You silly children!

12
00:01:04.524 --> 00:01:09.383
Tristay: I will become more powerful than even you can imagine!

13
00:01:09.384 --> 00:01:18.489
Tristay: Three simple colors of clay could never defeat me. Ha-ha-ha-ha!

14
00:01:18.490 --> 00:01:21.028
Danny: What did Tristay just say?

15
00:01:21.029 --> 00:01:23.641
Tina: That he will become more powerful.

16
00:01:23.642 --> 00:01:27.800
Danny: No. He said three colors could never defeat him.

17
00:01:27.801 --> 00:01:29.675
Brad: What do you mean?

18
00:01:29.676 --> 00:01:31.655
Danny: Roy G. Biv.

19
00:01:31.656 --> 00:01:33.920
Tina: Roy G. Biv?

20
00:01:33.921 --> 00:01:40.522
Danny: That’s right: red, orange, yellow, green, blue, indigo, and violet.

21
00:01:40.523 --> 00:01:52.896
Brad: You mean the colors of the rainbow.

22
00:01:52.897 --> 00:01:54.658
Tina: What about them?

23
00:01:54.659 --> 00:01:58.816
Danny: If I mix the colors properly, I can make a rainbow.

24
00:01:58.817 --> 00:02:01.310
Tina: Do you think that would stop him?

25
00:02:01.311 --> 00:02:04.248
Brad: A rainbow contains every possible color.

26
00:02:04.249 --> 00:02:08.065
Brad: It’s the only thing strong enough to defeat him!

27
00:02:08.066 --> 00:02:10.505
Danny: Tristay will be sorry when he sees . . .

28
00:02:10.506 --> 00:02:13.712
Danny: Oh no! There’s no clay left!

29
00:02:13.713 --> 00:02:15.551
I’m out of clay!

30
00:02:15.552 --> 00:02:20.156
Tina: Check your other pockets!

31
00:02:20.157 --> 00:02:27.351
Danny: Oh, thank goodness!

32
00:02:27.352 --> 00:02:33.630
Tristay: Haven’t you given up yet?

33
00:02:33.631 --> 00:02:35.352
Tina: Oh no!

34
00:02:35.353 --> 00:02:39.649
Brad: If Tristay sucks up the magic clay, we’re doomed!

35
00:02:39.650 --> 00:02:46.216
Tina: Danny! We’ve got to do something!

36
00:02:46.217 --> 00:02:52.349
Brad: I hope I don’t regret this! Come on!

37
00:02:52.350 --> 00:02:59.636
Danny: I’ve almost got it.

38
00:02:59.637 --> 00:03:02.974
Tina: We’re fading!

39
00:03:02.975 --> 00:03:07.164
Brad: We’ve . . . got to . . . hang on.

40
00:03:07.165 --> 00:03:12.167
Danny is almost finished.

41
00:03:12.168 --> 00:03:15.464
Hopian: I’m coming!

42
00:03:15.465 --> 00:03:18.147
Tristay: Hopian! Blast you!

43
00:03:18.148 --> 00:03:22.833
You will never stop me again!

44
00:03:22.834 --> 00:03:26.085
Danny: Tristay, I’ve got a surprise for you.

45
00:03:26.086 --> 00:03:28.189
Tristay: You can’t stop me!

46
00:03:28.190 --> 00:03:31.513
I’ll suck the color and life out of you.

47
00:03:31.514 --> 00:03:36.401
Tristay: Say good-bye to everything you know, you bad little boy!

48
00:03:36.402 --> 00:03:38.038
Danny: I’m not bad!

49
00:03:38.039 --> 00:03:55.384
I . . . just . . . have . . . a big . . . imagination!
